'''Jungle Gourmet Tomoe''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Gals of Summer Blue Ocean (Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer Blue Ocean]] gacha event. She is an anti-[[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]]/[[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] variant of [[Ninja Girl Tomoe (Uber Rare Cat)|Ninja Girl Tomoe]] that was added in [[Version 15.5 Update#Version 15.5.1 Update|Version 15.5.1]].

